55
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:02,000
The sticky layer tool and the sticky layer plate.

56
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:05,000
Select the sticky layer tool in the 3D tool bar.

57
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:08,000
The position of the empty line can be added to the sticky layer.

58
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:11,000
Add the sticky layer to the bottom of the skirt.

59
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:13,000
The mouse is stopped at the bottom.

60
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:16,000
When the blue dot is displayed, it means that it can be added.

61
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:18,000
Click on the actual point.

62
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:22,000
In the bottom line, you can press the middle button to determine the direction.

63
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:24,000
Click on the double click.

64
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:26,000
The sticky layer added is completed.

65
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:33,000
In both the 3D window and 2D window, you can add the sticky layer.

66
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:37,000
Switch to the sticky layer tool or the moving tool.

67
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:40,000
The sticky layer is in the state of being selected.

68
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:45,000
In the property editor, you can set the basic information of the sticky layer.

69
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:50,000
The type is used to set the sticky layer on the inside, outside, or both sides.

70
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:51,000
Here is set as the inside.

71
00:03:51,000 --> 00:04:06,000
The bottom can be used to check and modify the width of the sticker, the length column can be used to check the length of the sticker, and modify its length value or percentage, such as from 120% to 120% of the length.

72
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:14,759
You can see that the longer sticker will be transcended and the particle diameter and conflict thickness of the sticker can also be adjusted.

73
00:04:15,659 --> 00:04:22,259
You can also choose the material of the sticker. The option only shows the material type available in the object window.

74
00:04:23,300 --> 00:04:27,699
You can also set the slash line direction or set the slash line angle directly.

75
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:29,439
Click to select the next spot.

76
00:04:29,759 --> 00:04:31,800
You can add a spot at the side of the sticker.

77
00:04:32,959 --> 00:04:33,740
On the side of the sticker,

78
00:04:33,899 --> 00:04:34,759
click the right button.

79
00:04:35,100 --> 00:04:35,639
It can be used to mark the surface of the sticker.

80
00:04:35,639 --> 00:04:35,959
It can also be used to mark the surface of the sticker.

81
00:04:35,959 --> 00:04:40,959
Set the initialization, counter-activation, freeze and surface flip.

82
00:04:40,959 --> 00:04:45,959
Next, use the side panel to make the side panel at the sleeve.

83
00:04:45,959 --> 00:04:48,959
There is already a centimeter of inner line at the sleeve.

84
00:04:48,959 --> 00:04:55,959
Use the hook outline tool and press the Shift key to select a circle of the line.

85
00:04:55,959 --> 00:05:01,959
On the selected line, right-click and select Hook as panel.

86
00:05:01,959 --> 00:05:04,959
The side panel of the hook will move with the mouse.

87
00:05:04,959 --> 00:05:09,959
Press the blank button to place the side panel.

88
00:05:09,959 --> 00:05:12,959
Use the adjustment panel tool to select it.

89
00:05:12,959 --> 00:05:15,959
Press the Ctrl key and press the D key.

90
00:05:15,959 --> 00:05:18,959
Press the side panel on the other side.

91
00:05:18,959 --> 00:05:23,959
Use the sewing tool to sew the side panel to the sleeve.

92
00:05:23,959 --> 00:05:30,959
In order to ensure that the side seam is even, the seam line at the bottom is folded.

93
00:05:30,959 --> 00:05:34,959
Select the side panel in the 3D window.

94
00:05:34,959 --> 00:05:38,959
On the panel, right-click and select Add to inside.

95
00:05:38,959 --> 00:05:43,959
The side panel will be added to the inside of the sleeve panel with the sewing line.

96
00:05:43,959 --> 00:05:45,959
And fit the shape of the sleeve.

97
00:05:45,959 --> 00:05:47,959
Finally, simulate.

98
00:05:47,959 --> 00:05:50,959
After the simulation is stable, turn off the simulation.

99
00:05:50,959 --> 00:05:53,959
